+Actual results:
+
+- false result (`noneV`) mutation: exit 1 with
+  `WarnStuckClaimState`; `vacuity.out` shows the actual returned
+  `str(joinCodes(... sortKeyVS ...))` cannot unify with `noneV`;
+- helper body changed to `return 9`: exit 1 with
